  "query": "My current work involves selecting cloud providers for regulated workloads.  Help me compare the most recent (as of 2026) compliance programs of AWS, Microsoft Azure, and Google Cloud across U.S., EU, and global requirements for data residency. Focus on industry-specific certifications (HIPAA, FedRAMP, SOC 2), breach notification procedures, and customer liability protection mechanisms. Provide:\n\n- A short description of each cloud provider’s compliance approach\n- A multi-column comparison table covering all dimensions\n- Multiple real-world enterprise case studies of compliance implementations in healthcare, financial services, and defense, drawing from both public sources and customer stories published by the providers\n- An analysis of strategic implications for enterprises choosing cloud providers for regulated industries"
